<title>TRINIDAD AND TOBAGO: CRICKET-WEST INDIES 118-1 IN 2ND INNINGS V INDIA - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES 118-1 IN 2ND INNINGS V INDIA - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>PORT OF SPAIN, Trinidad 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Indies,</p>
<p>140 runs behind India on first innings, were</p>
<p>118-1 in their second innings at the close on the fourth day of</p>
<p>the second test at the Queen's Park Oval on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: West Indies 296 and 118-1, India 436.</p>
</text>
